+   "upstream_change": "",
+   "review_accuracy": "accurate; both suggested fixes work (archFree() at arch.c:173-175 carries the same guard). The guard is complete for the hookless classes (cmplt, hcub, mesh2D/3D/XD, torus*, varcmplt, varhcub; dist until patch 0003). The classes with a hook are now called on a half-loaded body: tleaf/ltleaf/cmpltw/cmpltws/deco tolerate it (verified by running), sub and dist do not: those are COR-04 and COR-05.",
