+From 006e75e6fb91f7966f5cdc4a6e3b2242f764327c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:04:24 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 03/10] Fix routine name in internal error message of
+ `dgraphBand2Ptop()` and `dgraphGrow2Ptop()` [report R. Perry]
+
+The message is prefixed by `DGRAPHBANDGROWNSTR`, which already holds
+the routine name, so that it read `dgraphBand2dgraphBandPtop` or
+`dgraphGrow2dgraphBandPtop`.
+
+Refs: DGR-17
