+From e1a85140dcb656af7e9df79a557ccea9bfc57c93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:46:57 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Style fix
+
+---
