+-** value is read from the option array, and the
+-** imbalance ratio of the first constraint (e.g.
+-** 1.05) becomes a Scotch imbalance tolerance
+-** (e.g. 0.05).
++** value and the objective type are read from the
++** option array, and the imbalance ratio of the
++** first constraint (e.g. 1.05) becomes a Scotch
