@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+From d7415dd009526bd2ac9c28891bc9d17a5e95f080 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:11:12 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 07/15] Bugfix: test overlap partition statistics in CMake test
+ `gpart_overlap_2` [report R. Perry]
+
+Unlike its Makefile counterpart, the CMake test ran "gmtst" without
+the "-o" flag on an overlap partition, so that the mapping was read as
+a plain one and the overlap code path of "gmtst" was not exercised.
+
+Refs: BLD-05
+---
+ src/check/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
+ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
+
+diff --git a/src/check/CMakeLists.txt b/src/check/CMakeLists.txt
+index 0c4a9640..4071dde2 100644
