+From 9f8a3d9a23b34d0b57975b31fc230e1202de1e14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:56:45 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 051/232] Bugfix: do not run genetic algorithm with an empty
+ population [report PyScotch]
+
+With strategy parameter "pop=0", the per-thread deme size is zero, so
+that thread 0 copied the current partition before the beginning of its
+(empty) deme array, which is a heap buffer overflow.
+---
