diff --git a/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0122-Bugfix-do-not-return-freed-communication-array-on-er.patch b/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0122-Bugfix-do-not-return-freed-communication-array-on-er.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c96e658
--- /dev/null
+++ b/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0122-Bugfix-do-not-return-freed-communication-array-on-er.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+From 6c867c11ffe303c3736fc8af2048ebe6249122ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:50:07 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 122/232] Bugfix: do not return freed communication array on
+ error in `dgraphFoldComm()` [report PyScotch]
+
+In debug mode, the consistency checks at the end of `dgraphFoldComm()`
+free the communication data array on error, after its address has
+already been stored into the caller's pointer. The callers, which
+free this array when it is not NULL, then freed it a second time.
+
+Set the output pointers only once all checks have passed.
+---
+ src/libscotch/dgraph_fold_comm.c | 10 +++++-----
+ 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
+
