diff --git a/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0168-Bugfix-convert-MeTiS-v5-partitioning-parameters-into.patch b/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0168-Bugfix-convert-MeTiS-v5-partitioning-parameters-into.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f8b0955
--- /dev/null
+++ b/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0168-Bugfix-convert-MeTiS-v5-partitioning-parameters-into.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,562 @@
+From 2739cd681ade11d75131cd438bec702465c43532 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:20:46 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 168/232] Bugfix: convert MeTiS v5 partitioning parameters into
+ Scotch ones [report R. Perry]
+
+Since b72baf20, the MeTiS v5 partitioning routines turn `ubvec[0]`
+into a Scotch imbalance tolerance, but accept any value: a ratio
+lower than or equal to one, such as the 0.05 still used by
+"test_libmetis.c", yields a negative tolerance, so that the minimum
+part load is greater than the maximum one. With `ncon` greater than
+one, the interleaved vertex weight array was still read as one
+weight per vertex, and `ParMETIS_V3_PartKway()` ignored both `ubvec`
+and the stride of the `tpwgts` array.
+
+Both v5 routines now share `_SCOTCH_METIS_V5_PartGraph()`, which
+checks and converts the parameters: `ncon` must be positive and
+`ubvec[0]` greater than one, a NULL `ubvec` yields the default
+tolerance, and the first vertex constraint is gathered into a
+temporary array, as was already done for target part weights.
+`ParMETIS_V3_PartKway()` receives the same treatment: `ubvec[0]` is
+used to build the mapping strategy, and the vertex and part weights
+of the first constraint are gathered with the proper stride. The
+tests use MeTiS imbalance ratios.
+
+Refs: CLI-03, CLI-07
+---
+ doc/src/ptscotch/p_l.tex                  |  11 +-
+ src/check/test_libmetis.c                 |  87 +++++++++++++++-
+ src/check/test_libparmetis.c              |  28 +++++
+ src/libscotchmetis/metis_graph_part.c     | 119 ++++++++++++++++------
+ src/libscotchmetis/parmetis_dgraph_part.c |  67 ++++++++++--
+ 5 files changed, 265 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)
+
+diff --git a/doc/src/ptscotch/p_l.tex b/doc/src/ptscotch/p_l.tex
