diff --git a/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0177-Bugfix-report-failures-of-the-ordering-and-symbolic-.patch b/upstream/reports/7.0.18/series/0177-Bugfix-report-failures-of-the-ordering-and-symbolic-.patch
