+From 37fd531c034ac78c123706b8e10f4b323d3ae222 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:08:34 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 207/232] Bugfix: require the CMake version that the build
+ files need [report R. Perry]
