+pointer cached at entry (`const ArchDom * restrict const domntab = grafptr->m.domntab;`), but the fallback's
+recursive bipartitioning reallocates grafptr->m.domntab (kgraphMapRbPart3 -> mapResize) when a variable-sized
+target gets more than min(1023, vertnbr)+1 domains. vardom.c = GRA-02/gra02int.c with k <= 0 selecting vcmplt.
+  sh ../common/cc.sh <tree> vardom vardom.c -I. ; LD_LIBRARY_PATH=<tree>/lib ./vardom 40 0 2
+  pristine 7.0.18 : dies earlier in GRA-02's overflow (kgraphMapFmTablGet kgraph_map_fm.c:129)
