+/**                buted graph growing routine of          **/
+/**                the libScotch library.                  **/
+/**                                                        **/
+/**   DATES      : # Version 6.0  : from : 26 sep 2012     **/
+/**                                 to   : 21 may 2018     **/
+/**                # Version 7.0  : from : 27 aug 2019     **/
+/**                                 to   : 21 jan 2023     **/
